{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_synopsis", "source_sha256": "707305b69f2353aebbf91db9a60faf4488331c2c20fca4aef9f16c4a0b14f8bc", "ja": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! SPECIAL DAY2を\n無事に終え、これまでのこと……\nそして、これからのことを話し合う\n社長と事務員たちの一幕です。", "zh": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! SPECIAL DAY2\n顺利落幕后，社长与事务员们\n畅谈起至今为止的种种往事……\n以及未来的那一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "e19d607668bf2279a7ea39c0fef0fba5c8175646d51355c87a6cd8be44019ce0", "ja": "仙台、神戸、福岡、そして今回の追加公演！\nぜーんぶ、走り抜けることができました～！", "zh": "仙台、神户、福冈，还有这次的追加公演！\n我们终于顺利跑完全部行程啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1002_101kot", "source_sha256": "5b5724e48b351439ad2d743cb0ac3fd6bf754ae4ff2c83e64b31632bd5ac61fa", "ja": "美咲ちゃん、長いライブツアーをよく頑張ったわね。\n本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "美咲，你真的辛苦完成了这么漫长的巡演呢。真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "cc4797c66ffdc32809a43db517c79972a39c5302b79fdf3bb0f695d4c6135daa", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます！\n音無先輩も、お疲れさまでした～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您！\n音无前辈也辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "6d1b55e7f67435bc19ed770fc2f7f57242e97e1da5e32d87374c88d9271cc878", "ja": "でも、劇場から生まれたユニットのみんなが、劇場を\n飛び出して活躍する姿を、ずっと見てましたから……。", "zh": "不过，因为一直看着剧场孕育出的各个组合走出剧场大展身手的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "992c308db4aa37eba2392d5be3d4dd1ae70f1ef76f2c359a323c180faddf393d", "ja": "ツアーが始まってから私、ずっとわくわくして！\n毎日とっても楽しかったです♪", "zh": "巡演开始后，我一直都特别兴奋！每天都过得特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "8f9e9879ea689ba65f97e3dc7b441f3c739f6048bd470dfa56a7f1b3815362c3", "ja": "そうよね！　ユニットだけじゃなくて映画のメンバー\nも、とっても素敵なステージを見せてくれたし！", "zh": "没错！不只是组合成员，电影的成员们也为我们带来了非常精彩的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "0310d3de66ca3f57fae0204d4c9cc17dd93a3ebe5616ba1aa01a6198b8f60b29", "ja": "他にも、今までのいろいろなお仕事の歌を\n聞かせてもらったり……。ふふっ♪", "zh": "另外，还听到了大家演唱以前各种工作的歌曲……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "175355282677578ff41961793b0440b96a4a47e753d92ef3ca9f6b2648972482", "ja": "ツアーが楽しかったのは、アイドルのみんなと\n美咲ちゃんが、たくさん練習して、頑張った成果……。", "zh": "巡演之所以这么开心，是偶像们和美咲练习了很多、努力付出的成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "ffc2f6139d22656a134980d7f08bad13bc87ff06db106d009051a9e780a3440f", "ja": "あらためて美咲ちゃん。\n本当に、お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "美咲，再次说一声，真的辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "6ef94e1cffab3c2384ac83ffd36f2dca089d838d4f6bc005177ce355f84bb69f", "ja": "音無先輩……。", "zh": "音无前辈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1011_president", "source_sha256": "739c3a1cd09a1784443476483c0173f9da5c8d1d6a162a1a62a551fcd807e11b", "ja": "私からも言わせてもらおうかな。\n青羽君、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "那我也说几句吧。\n青羽同学，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "9147b4533214be0cd9c40d5fd61eff1650b61806b3aa9e7c3a3295ecfaecef0e", "ja": "あっ、社長さん！", "zh": "啊，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1013_president", "source_sha256": "ffb7648086788e03cf8e4013f0537905b8e14ee30fb16b3b1ecb515abea421ed", "ja": "このライブツアーは、765プロライブ劇場としての、\n今日までの活動の集大成のようなものだった。", "zh": "这次巡演，仿佛是作为765专业演出剧场一路走到今天的活动集大成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1014_president", "source_sha256": "4017982855fd2e87ddc514d9834dca216622e1013b675dbb6ba883dba7e1e7a2", "ja": "そういう意味では、まさに青羽君の集大成、\nともいえるツアーだったのかもしれないね。", "zh": "从这个意义上来说，这或许正是一场可以称为青羽集大成的巡演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "ac49a6a4dcbb16dee35880d58a0ab8c98bef6185841a75ad0998e2de52580365", "ja": "社長さん……。", "zh": "社长……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1016_president", "source_sha256": "69289bee3420662eb360c2d744641d92d016288082a16f2e44b32cb93425ae79", "ja": "だが！　それはあくまでも、\n今日までの集大成、ということだ！", "zh": "但是！那不过是截至今天的集大成而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1017_president", "source_sha256": "9a3479d16ee8185418f917247db9f564f06d31ea061cf4b209825738c83cc2fe", "ja": "我が765プロライブ劇場は、明日からまた更なる\n飛躍を目指して、活動を続けていく。", "zh": "我们的765Pro Live剧场，从明天起也将继续以实现更进一步的飞跃为目标开展活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1018_president", "source_sha256": "b637ea36e2eb535ebc3c817c630ea4194979b2854678d8820a93c7c52ae04fb6", "ja": "これからも我々は、アイドル諸君と心をひとつにして、\n頑張っていこうじゃないか。", "zh": "今后我们也要和各位偶像心连心，一起努力下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1019_president", "source_sha256": "9a48d5a59130152571599f1494ecbb827ebbb7db98b9d5fda32c2cffc5d86116", "ja": "そう、また新たな集大成の日を……。\n輝ける未来を迎えるために！", "zh": "没错，为了迎接闪耀的未来，再次迎来全新的集大成之日……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "d4067e0cf5c93d20a39d7ffe654312c832af492182ab19991611baa96d8ce1d7", "ja": "社長さん……。わかりました！　青羽美咲、\nこれからも劇場事務員として、一生懸命頑張ります♪", "zh": "社长……。我明白了！青羽美咲，\n今后也会作为剧场工作人员，继续努力加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "e276c6cdffffae258345576fea1ac816593292177c49ab9d1caff68cdedfc83a", "ja": "ふふっ、社長？　すっかり熱くなっちゃってるみたい\nですけど、そういうお話は、打ち上げでしませんか？", "zh": "呵呵，社长？您似乎已经完全热血沸腾起来了，不过这种话，还是留到庆功宴上再说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1022_president", "source_sha256": "a9f1c8d31eca419e57939e5067755a752b456895f20677e952d820b258466138", "ja": "おお、そういえば！　これから、\nアイドル諸君も交えての打ち上げだったね。", "zh": "哦，对了！接下来还要和偶像们一起办庆功宴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1023_president", "source_sha256": "4af2ead143a3a17fe8a15c8654c698535e231d1a35db0938c26f20d3af94219e", "ja": "今日は皆のために、私の行きつけのレストランを\n貸し切りにしたことだし……。", "zh": "今天我还把我常去的餐厅\n包下来了，给大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1024_president", "source_sha256": "12501ddfa873623696e8c246f20344ab13673c3e5a1016dece6e5ec25b4d53d4", "ja": "よし！　何はともあれ、まず今回のツアーの\n苦労話や思い出話に、皆で花を咲かせるとしよう！", "zh": "好！总之，先让我们一起聊聊这次巡演的辛苦经历和难忘回忆吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1025_102mis", "source_sha256": "0c8f4e0d8ff2ddcb50d539d2b26650f30edab808e2a5ef4040da79357bb98c32", "ja": "わぁ、社長さん行きつけのお店なんですか？\n楽しみだなぁ～♪", "zh": "哇，是社长常去的店吗？\n好期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1026_president", "source_sha256": "284318d7f09392a3025e92439356b08c476898d534f0e698de945e2a190a3ccd", "ja": "ほら、君！　君も早く準備したまえ。\nアイドル諸君も、会いたがっているよ！", "zh": "喂，就是你！你也快点准备吧。  \n偶像们也都很想见你呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "6d81903fbd9b5961f579bd2d951164d529fbeadb38406ab49f0b8748bb9f140b", "ja": "ステージを終えたアイドルたちを労うのも、\n{$P$}さんの役目ですからね♪", "zh": "慰劳结束舞台表演的偶像们，也是{$P$}先生的职责哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "29e2cb35ac7de514b11a40e7269e90340f47b12adc1262458f876306ccf60326", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}さん、美咲ちゃん！\n私達765プロ社員チームも、今夜は楽しみましょう♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生、美咲！  \n我们765事务所的员工团队今晚也一起好好享受吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_11_1029_102mis", "source_sha256": "363ae5b7c7e18c4ae1e65fd649123c154de76160ca06944bf82c52ebb4451bef", "ja": "はーい！　これからも、みんなで一緒に、\nどこまでも……頑張っていきましょうね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "好——！接下来大家也一起，无论走到哪里……都要继续努力哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
